    <string name="about_suraksha_body">Suraksha helps you detect scam calls, fake UPI requests, phishing, and loan scams. Paste or share a suspicious message, scan your SMS inbox, or upload a call recording — Suraksha analyzes it and shows a risk score with a simple explanation in your own chosen language. If a high-risk scam is detected, your Family Guardian can be alerted automatically.</string>
